## The 15-Step Pipeline

| Step | Name | Input → Output |
|------|------|----------------|
| 1 | **Requirement** | Natural language engineering need |
| 2 | **AI Interpretation** | NL → Structured JSON parameters |
| 3 | **Validation** | Check for missing/invalid/out-of-range params |
| 4 | **CAD Generation** | Parameters → Parametric L-bracket (template-based) |
| 5 | **Meshing** | Solid geometry → Finite elements (triangles/tetrahedra) |
| 6 | **FEA** | Solve K·u = F → stress, displacement, strain |
| 7 | **Result Analysis** | Extract max stress, displacement, safety factor |
| 8 | **Optimization** | Topology optimization (SIMP) to minimize mass |
| 9 | **New FEA** | Re-analyze optimized geometry |
| 10 | **Reconstruction** | Density field → Clean CAD (surface extraction + cleanup) |
| 11 | **Validation FEA** | Independent FEA on reconstructed geometry |
| 12 | **Human Review** | Engineer checks manufacturability |
| 13 | **Accept/Modify/Reject** | Decision gate with feedback loop |
| 14 | **Export** | STEP / STL output |
| 15 | **Report** | Complete engineering report with optimization history |

