## Complexity Analysis Summary

| Module | Time Complexity | Notes |
|--------|----------------|-------|
| UI Input | O(n) where n = fields | Trivial |
| AI Interpreter | O(1) per LLM call | API latency-bound |
| Validator | O(n) where n = params | Linear scan |
| CAD Generation | O(k) where k = operations | Linear in parametric ops; kernel internals vary |
| Meshing | Depends on element count N | Implementation-dependent |
| FEA Solve | O(N³) dense, much less sparse | K·u = F with sparse solvers |
| Topology Opt | I × FEA_cost | Iterative; expensive due to repeated FEA |
| Reconstruction | Depends on mesh density | Surface extraction + fitting |

